			Label 31571: itemFocusOut="{pModel.selectAliasDef(dgAlias.selectedItem as AliasDef)};entityIDChange();" (This was the last solution. Now the grid is disabled.)
			itemEditEnd="this.pModel.aliasCurrentSelectedDef.disableAutoUpdate()" (disable the sort on the grid)
			itemEditEnd="{pModel.selectAliasDef(dgAlias.selectedItem as AliasDef)};entityIDChange();" (this also worked, like "itemFocusOut")
